  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your body heals itself at a rapid rate.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Fast Healer<sup>APG</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> The bonus hit points you gain from the Fast Healer feat are equal to your Constitution modifier. In addition, you may spend a use of mythic power as a swift action to gain fast healing equal to your Constitution modifier for a number of rounds equal to your mythic tier.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-a-f-feats#toc136\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
